          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Look at Fig. 10.4. "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Compare",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " the two set-ups labelled as A and B, and analyse."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.126,
            0.265,
            0.492,
            0.451
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "In Fig. 10.4, set-up A is placed in sunlight, and set-up B is placed in the dark. What difference do you observe in the two set-ups? Do you observe air bubbles emerging in the inverted test tube in set-up A? The gas produced in this set-up caused bubbles to emerge and get accumulated in the inverted test tube. Which gas is this?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
