          "bbox": [
            0.294,
            0.599,
            0.708,
            0.706
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "When sufficient gas was accumulated in the inverted test tube, Barkha didi placed her thumb on the mouth of the test tube while taking the test tube off the set-up. She then quickly inserted a lit matchstick into the tube and the matchstick produced an intense flame."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.178,
            0.743,
            0.646,
            0.817
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "She inferred that the gas in the test tube is rich in oxygen. It indicates that oxygen is released during the process of photosynthesis. It also indicates that photosynthesis occurs in the presence of sunlight."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
